    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_Room Availability Management API",
    "description": "The Room Availability Management API enables users to efficiently manage hotel room availability. By allowing for the submission of availability data, this API supports hotel operators in optimizing their inventory and maximizing occupancy rates. It is particularly useful for front desk systems, booking platforms, and accommodation management tools. Developers can leverage this API to create or update room availability information, ensuring that guests have access to accurate and real-time data when making reservations.",
